    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DEERPARK, ENNISTYMON, CO. CLARE V95 X5E5 ON C. 0.25 ACRES.\r\n\r\n1 BEDROOM SEMI DETACHED HOUSE \r\n\r\nIDEAL LOCATION /ENNISTYMON TOWN/A SHORT STROLL TO ALL AMENITIES\r\n\r\nAN EARLY VIEWING IS ADVISED!\r\n\r\nVIEWINGS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT WITH SOLE AGENT STREETS AHEAD PROPERTIES.\r\nCOMPANY LICENCE NUMBER 003178\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n \r\nThis is the ideal, cosy 1-bedroom semi-detached, roadside property presented in excellent condition perfect for one or two people either for full-time living or as a holiday base. A short stroll to Ennistymon town centre and within close proximity to all local amenities making this a superb location. Lahinch beach and Golf Club both easily accessible, just 3 km from the property. Ennis is a 35-minute drive. \r\n\r\nEnnistymon offers a selection of excellent primary and secondary schools, shops, banks, crèche, medical facilities, church and post office on the doorstep. As Ennistymon is the main North Clare town, this makes it a bustling, welcoming and friendly town every day of the year! \r\n\r\nAccommodation is comprised of an entrance porch, open plan living/kitchen/dining room, 1 double bedroom, shower room and hot-press. Oil fired central heating throughout with a solid fuel stove. PVC double glazed windows, aluminium front door.\r\n\r\nLean to shed which houses the oil tank and burner. This house has recently been reroofed and new chimney reinstated. High level of insulation installed including attic.\r\n\r\nAmple ground to the side and rear of this property with a gated entrance, ideal for extending, planting and indeed off-street parking.\r\n\r\nMains water with private septic tank.\r\n\r\nApproximate floor area 41.39 sq. meters (445.52 sq. feet).\r\nConstructed in 1850.\r\nBER G.\r\n\r\n Viewings strictly by appointment with sole agent Streets Ahead Properties.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION – APPROXIMATE DIMENSIONS\r\n\r\nEntrance porch: (1.66m x 0.98m) Tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/living/dining: (4.73m x 3.29m) plus (3.33m x 1.15m) Complete with laminated flooring, solid fuel stove, timber mantle and surround with a tiled base, electric cooker and extractor, dishwasher and washing machine. Recessed storage cupboard. Attic access. Dual aspect.\r\n\r\nBedroom: (4.66m x 2.34m) Bright double room with dual aspect. Carpeted flooring. Complete with extra underfloor (4 inch) insulation.\r\n\r\nRear hallway: (2.09m x 0.90m) plus (0.89m x 0.53m) Tiled flooring. Hot press is included in the dimensions. Leads to the shower room.\r\n\r\nShower room: (2m x 1.72m) Fully tiled with rear aspect. Complete with an electric shower unit, w.c. and w.h.b and vanity unit."
      },
      {
